\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Harder problems of the same domain exhibit fewer solution modes.} When we ask the Qwen2.5-Instruct family and GPT-5.6 Sol increasingly difficult questions from harder levels of \textsc  {ModeBench}{}, \texttt  {pass@8} declined and so too does \texttt  {PCMD}{}. For our benchmark, as problems get harder, solution mode collapse worsens.}}{4}{figure.16}\protected@file@percent }
