\newlabel{tab:absolute-support-references}{{21}{52}{\textbf {Uniform actions and untrained checkpoints provide absolute diversity references.} \emph {Uniform} samples the exposed action representation uniformly and is defined only for \texttt {Graph} (27 color strings) and \texttt {PantryPlan} (64 bit masks). Initial is the matched pass-0 model; the final two columns are pass-8 means. Values are raw \distk {}; dashes indicate domains without a specified uniform-action reference}{table.217}{}}
